Content attributions (see /about in the app):

- Quran text is public domain, verified against the standard mushaf.
- Quran translations and reciter audio: Islamic Network (https://islamic.network),
  openly licensed.
- Hadith collections: fawazahmed0/hadith-api (https://github.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api),
  open license.
- Prayer-time and Hijri refinement: AlAdhan API (https://aladhan.com), keyless and free.
- Magnetic declination: NOAA Geomag (https://www.ngdc.noaa.gov), public domain.
